{"sourceUrl":"https://dce.jlu.edu.cn/info/1032/11077.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:06.122349+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://dce.jlu.edu.cn/info/1032/11077.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>为了确保我院</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年接收推荐免试攻读研究生（以下简称</span><span>“推免生”）的复试录取工作规范有序，根据《吉林大学</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年接收推荐免试攻读研究生复试录取工作办法》，结合我院的实际</span></span><span><span>情况，制定本办法。</span></span></p>\n<h3><span><span>一、推免硕士生报考条件</span></span></h3>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，具有正确的政治方向，热爱祖国，愿意为社会主义现代化建设服务，遵纪守法，品行端正。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>具有所在学校推免生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较好的专业素养，有较强的创新意识和创新能力，有较高的培养潜质。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>身体和心理状况符合国家和招生单位规定的体检要求。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、接收推免生专业代码及人数</span></span></p>\n<div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>代码</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>专业</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>人数</span></span></strong></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>081000</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>信息与通信工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>19</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>081100</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>控制科学与工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>11</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>085402</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>通信工程（含宽带网络、移动通信等）</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>25</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>085406</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>控制工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>14</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>081000</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>信息与通信工程（直博，仅招校外考生）</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>1</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、</span></span></strong><span><span>提交材料及资格审核</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>居民身份证、学生证扫描件各一份。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>《吉林大学</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年接收推荐免试研究生申请表》一份（见附件）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>加盖所在学校教务部门公章的本科期间成绩单扫描件一份。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>在校期间发表的论文、获得专利的证书、研究成果证明、获奖证书、外语水平考试证书等材料扫描件。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.</span></span> <span><span>申请直博生须有至少两名所报考学科专业领域内的教授</span></span><span><span>(</span></span><span><span>或相当专业技术职称的专家</span></span><span><span>)</span></span><span><span>的书面推荐意见。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>以上材料编辑成一个</span></span><span><span>pdf</span></span><span><span>文件于</span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>16:00</span></span><span><span>之前发送至</span></span><span><span>txyjsb@163.com</span></span><span><span>，邮件请以</span></span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://dce.jlu.edu.cn/__local/1/5A/D4/EC02C9B1DFFEBA86AE3F6D5B775_BDCB0F85_117E.png\"/></span><span><span>申报专业</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>姓名命名</span></span><span><span>,</span></span><span><span>如为校园学术活动开放日合格人员请在邮件名称中标注</span><span>“学术活动开放日”；未参加或非合格人员邮件发送成功后加入微信群，群二维码见附件，进群后修改备注：申报专业</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>姓名。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四、学院复试组织管理</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院成立接收推免生工作领导小组、监督检查小组、资格审查小组、复试工作小组等。推免工作咨询电话：</span></span><span><span>0431-85095775</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>质疑申诉电话：</span></span><span><span>0431-85152253</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、复试方式和内容</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>复试内容和方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）考核考生的专业知识、综合素质和能力，包括思想政治素质和道德品德、专业基础知识、专业知识、外语水平、实践能力及人文素质、科研能力和创新意识等。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>复试采取线下笔试和面试相结合的形式。包括专业课笔试、综合面试、英语听说能力测试。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>专业课笔试占</span></span><span><span>50%</span></span><span><span>，综合面试加英语听说能力占</span></span><span><span>50%</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>专业课具体如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>信息与通信工程：单片机原理与应用、模拟与数字电子技术</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>控制科学与工程：计算机控制技术，电力拖动自动控制系统</span></span> </p>\n<p><span><span>通信工程（含宽带网络、移动通信等）：单片机原理与应用、模拟与数字电子技术</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>控制工程：计算机控制技术，电力拖动自动控制系统</span></span> </p>\n<p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>综合面试主要考核考生的专业知识、综合素质和能力：主要包括考生的思想政治素质和道德品质、语言表达能力、考生应用所学专业知识分析和解决实际问题的能力，考生本人学习、工作中的业绩情况，考生的人文素养，举止言行、表达能力和礼仪等。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>六、复试成绩及录取</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>复试成绩满分</span></span><span><span>100</span></span><span><span>分，</span></span><span><span>60</span></span><span><span>分以上（含</span></span><span><span>60</span></span><span><span>分）为合格。复试不合格者不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>拟录取推免生严格按照复试成绩由高到低的顺序，在推免生招生名额内择优录取，校园学术活动开放日合格人员不参加复试，已有成绩作为重要依据，具体情况以拟录取名单为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>思想政治素质和道德品质考核不合格者不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>七、工作日程</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>18</span></span><span><span>日前在学院网页上公布推免生复试名单。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span>日上午</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>30</span></span><span><span>开始进行推免生复试。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>22</span></span><span><span>日前公示拟录取推免生名单；</span></span><span><span>组织复试合格推免生通过教育部推免生信息公开暨管理服务系统完成</span><span>“待录取确认”。</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>吉林大学通信工程学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"0018289e849121ee5d020ce84dfefe04169f9c4dc6f122c65446b29f8f5a48b2","textLength":1464,"sourceSha256":"bd29df0cea0f1b848e1e30d275be473d52d5a2c2efbe65e3b7de5148c580a55b","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"申请表.docx","url":"https://dce.jlu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1409281823&wbfileid=16644898"},{"name":"二维码.docx","url":"https://dce.jlu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1409281823&wbfileid=16644899"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c2729fcac2685f874aa0","title":"2025年吉林大学通信工程学院2026年接收推荐免试攻读研究生复试录取工作办法","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:06.122349+00:00"}
